flowchart TD

    A([User sends a message]) --> B{State 0:<br/>Detect Language}

    B -->|English| C[State 1:<br/>Greeting & Intent]
    B -->|Arabic| C

    C --> D{User Intent}

    D -->|Book Appointment| E[State 2:<br/>Choose Service]

    D -->|Ask Question| F[Answer FAQ]

    F --> C

    E --> G[State 3:<br/>Ask Preferred Date]

    G --> H[State 4:<br/>Offer Available Time Slots]

    H --> I{User Selects Slot}

    I -->|Yes| J[State 5:<br/>Confirm Booking]

    J --> K([Booking Completed])

    %% Human Handoff
    C --> L{Medical Advice?<br/>Complaint?<br/>Price Negotiation?<br/>Unknown Request?}

    E --> L
    G --> L
    H --> L

    L --> M[Transfer to Human Agent]

    %% Language Switching
    C -. User switches language .-> B
    E -. User switches language .-> B
    G -. User switches language .-> B
    H -. User switches language .-> B
    J -. User switches language .-> B

    %% No Reply Flow
    J --> N{No Reply}

    N --> O[+1 Hour Reminder]

    O --> P{Still No Reply?}

    P --> Q[+24 Hour Template Reminder]

    Q --> R{Still No Reply?}

    R --> S[+72 Hour Template Reminder]

    S --> T([Lead Marked Lost])